        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jodie Foster, Alan Di Fiore, Jim Kouf, Jamie Linden, Giancarlo Esposito, Olivia Luccardi, Juno Temple, Julia Garner, Alessandro Nivola, Maggie Siff, Philip Ettinger\n- Products: Money Monster, Breaking Bad, Better Call Saul, It Follows, The Rewrite, One Percent More Humid\n- Awards: Critics' Choice Television Awards, Primetime Emmy Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Giancarlo Giuseppe Alessandro Esposito was born on April 26, 1958, and he is an American actor.\n- Giancarlo Esposito won the 2012 Critics' Choice Television Award for Best Supporting Actor in a Drama for playing Gustavo \"Gus\" Fring on Breaking Bad and Better Call Saul.\n- Giancarlo Esposito was also nominated in 2012 for the Primetime Emmy Award for Outstanding Supporting Actor in a Drama Series for the same role.\n- Money Monster is a 2016 American thriller film directed by Jodie Foster and written by Alan Di Fiore, Jim Kouf, and Jamie Linden.\n- Olivia Luccardi is known for playing Yara in It Follows, Chloe in The Rewrite, and Arlene in Money Monster.\n- One Percent More Humid stars Juno Temple, Julia Garner, Alessandro Nivola, Maggie Siff, Olivia Luccardi, and Philip Ettinger.",
